---
// Footer 2 — bold dark footer: newsletter sign-up, link columns and an oversized wordmark.
---

<footer class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-20 sm:pt-24">
    <div class="grid gap-12 border-b border-white/10 pb-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-end lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-300">Stay in the loop</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">A calmer week starts with one email.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">The Calm Dispatch arrives once a month with one idea for working with less noise. No tracking, no tricks.</p>
      </div>
      <form action="#" method="post" class="w-full">
        <label for="footer2-email" class="text-sm font-medium text-white/80">Work email</label>
        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <input id="footer2-email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" class="w-full flex-1 rounded-button border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-5 py-3.5 text-white placeholder:text-white/40 focus:border-brand-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-400" />
          <button type="submit" class="rounded-button bg-white px-7 py-3.5 font-semibold text-brand-950 transition hover:bg-brand-100">Subscribe</button>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-white/50">Read by 18,000 team leads. Unsubscribe in one click.</p>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 py-16 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Product</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/#features" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Features</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pricing" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Pricing</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Integrations</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Changelog</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Company</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/about" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Careers</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Resources</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="#" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Help centre</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">Templates</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">API docs</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">System status</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Say hello</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="mailto:hello@halcyon.app" class="text-white/60 transition hover:text-white">hello@halcyon.app</a></li>
          <li><span class="text-white/60">14 Lantern Yard, London</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-white/60">Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm GMT</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pointer-events-none select-none px-6" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="bg-linear-to-b from-white/15 to-white/0 bg-clip-text text-center font-display text-[22vw] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tighter text-transparent lg:text-[17rem]">Halcyon</p>
  </div>

  <div class="relative border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-6 text-sm sm:flex-row">
      <p class="text-white/50">© 2026 Halcyon Labs, Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Legal" class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="#" class="text-white/50 transition hover:text-white">Privacy</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-white/50 transition hover:text-white">Terms</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-white/50 transition hover:text-white">Cookies</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
